<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea grains/oilseeds tender results in Sept.</title>
<headline>S.Korea grains/oilseeds tender results in Sept.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea bought during September at least 572,500 tonnes of corn, 107,500 tonnes of U.S. wheat, 75,000 tonnes of U.S. soybean, 40,000 tonnes of Brazilian soymeal, 50,000 tonnes of Canadian feed wheat and 50,000 tonnes of Canadian feed barley through tenders and private</p>
<p>negotiations.</p>
